    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3751" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arrīsor</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adr-</span></b> ), ōris, m.
